request.description:
Returns all **active** states.

**Auth:** Admin Bearer token required.

**Success Response — 200:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "statusCode": 200,
  "message": "States fetched successfully.",
  "data": {
    "states": [
      {
        "_id": "664f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d",
        "name": "Lagos",
        "normalizedName": "lagos",
        "status": "active",
        "deliveryCovered": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Public endpoint — no authentication required.**

Returns all active states where `deliveryCovered` is `true`. Frontend should call this to populate state dropdowns shown to guests (e.g. when choosing a delivery address).

**Success Response — 200:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "statusCode": 200,
  "message": "Delivery-covered states fetched.",
  "data": {
    "states": [
      {
        "_id": "664f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d",
        "name": "Lagos",
        "normalizedName": "lagos"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

Returns all **active** delivery fee records with populated state and city names.

**Auth:** Admin Bearer token required.

**Success Response — 200:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "statusCode": 200,
  "message": "Delivery fees fetched.",
  "data": {
    "deliveryFees": [
      {
        "_id": "664f...",
        "pickupState": { "_id": "664f...0d", "name": "Lagos" },
        "pickupCity": { "_id": "664f...1a", "name": "Ikeja" },
        "destinationState": { "_id": "664f...2b", "name": "Abuja" },
        "destinationCity": { "_id": "664f...3c", "name": "Garki" },
        "fee": 3500,
        "status": "active"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```
